{"duration_api_ms":275812,"stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"0204548c-a824-57b7-bea3-1783011bc81a","total_cost_usd":2.3845430000000003,"usage":{"input_tokens":18,"cache_creation_input_tokens":10231,"cache_read_input_tokens":821017,"output_tokens":6814,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":480},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":10231,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1185,"cache_read_input_tokens":96525,"cache_creation_input_tokens":152,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":152},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"modelUsage":{"claude-opus-5-5":{"inputTokens":94,"outputTokens":18462,"cacheReadInputTokens":3249365,"cacheCreationInputTokens":65961,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":1.542563,"contextWindow":1000000,"maxOutputTokens":128000,"thinkingTokens":4082,"cacheCreationEphemeral5mInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationEphemeral1hInputTokens":64423,"canonicalModel":"claude-opus-5-5","provider":"firstParty","costBasis":"list"},"claude-fable-5-1":{"inputTokens":54228,"outputTokens":5994,"cacheReadInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationInputTokens":0,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.84198,"contextWindow":1000000,"maxOutputTokens":64000,"thinkingTokens":0,"cacheCreationEphemeral5mInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationEphemeral1hInputTokens":0,"canonicalModel":"claude-fable-5-1","provider":"firstParty","costBasis":"list"}},"permission_denials":[],"terminal_reason":"completed","fast_mode_state":"off","fast_mode_disabled_reason":"sdk_opt_in_required","origin":{"kind":"task-notification","producer":"session-task","runId":"0mvzk4mi4-f5beeac3"},"subagent_stats":{"spawned":0,"requested":{"background":0,"foreground":0,"unset":0},"started_in_background":0,"max_depth":0,"spawned_by_subagents":0,"completed":0,"failed":0,"killed":{"parent":0,"user":0,"system":0},"refused":{"depth_limit":0,"concurrency_limit":0,"budget":0},"by_type":{}},"safety_stops":0,"is_error":false,"num_turns":9,"subtype":"success","api_error_status":null,"result":"I found the causes of two of the three problems, but saves under load still fail. Everything is committed (`4497525`).\n\nThe packet itself was incomplete: its target file list, contract and acceptance commands were still template placeholders. So the only files I changed are the packet's Executor log, `friction.jsonl` and two spawn requests. There were no acceptance commands to run; `theseus validate` gives 0 errors and one warning about pilot mode. PKT-0018's scripts aren't on this branch yet, so I patched copies in my scratchpad folder.\n\n**1. Why 200 docs × 5 clients gave no result.** This was a bug in the test script, not a server limit.\n- When a second editor joins a document, DocService locks it and expects the first editor to send `unLockDocument` within 30 s (the `expire.lockDoc` setting). If it doesn't, the server drops that editor.\n- The test script never sends `unLockDocument`, and it opens documents one after another. With 200 documents, opening takes 38–110 s, so the first documents wait more than 30 s for their first change and get dropped.\n- The script then waits for a `saveLock` reply that never comes, and that wait has no timeout, so it hangs. In one run 71 documents were dropped.\n- 100 × 10 opened in under 30 s, which is why PKT-0018 didn't hit it.\n\nAfter sending `unLockDocument` and adding a timeout, there was no ceiling up to 2,000 sockets, with no errors:\n\n| Docs × clients | Sockets | Broadcasts/s | Ack p99 | DocService CPU |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 200 × 5 | 1,000 | 1,574 | 28 ms | 0.40 core |\n| 200 × 10 | 2,000 | 3,541 | 28 ms | 0.54 core |\n\nI didn't go higher because the load generator shares the VM's 2 CPUs with the server.\n\n**2. Valid saves under load: not done.** Every save still returns status 3, even for one document with one change on a blank docx. x2t fails to apply the replayed change because it points to objects created in the browser session it was captured from. Fixing it means capturing a full typing sequence in a browser and replaying it in order, so I requested a follow-up packet. The save timings (138–143 s for 200 docs) only show how long the failing saves take.\n\n**3. The 124 s pptx → pdf conversion is explained.** The converter runs one job at a time (`maxprocesscount` 1), and save assembly goes through the same queue.\n- On an idle server, 10 conversions of deck-50.pptx took 2.0–2.8 s.\n- Started right after a load test closed its sockets, the third conversion took 68.7 s, waiting behind 100 queued saves.\n- In PKT-0018 the conversion test ran right after its load test, and deck-50 was the first file converted. I couldn't check PKT-0018's own logs because they no longer exist.\n\n**Follow-up packets requested** (in `.theseus/spawn/`):\n- Record these findings in `baseline.md` and the perf scripts once PKT-0018 is merged.\n- Make saves under load valid using a browser-captured change sequence.\n\n**Lessons for the Atlas** (also written into the packet):\n- Synthetic co-edit clients must send `unLockDocument` after opening, or the server drops them after 30 s.\n- One DocService process handles 2,000 sockets and 3,500 broadcasts/s on about half a CPU core.\n- Conversions wait behind queued saves, so let the converter queue drain between a load test and conversion timing.","ttft_ms":2884,"type":"result","duration_ms":202402,"uuid":"5dc63155-03b5-4248-8f46-d577047e34f9","ttft_stream_ms":574,"time_to_request_ms":59,"time_to_request_phases_ms":{"other":3,"system_prompt":3,"resume_other":0,"process_user_input":2,"input_attachments":20,"input_hooks":2,"conversation_append":1,"transcript_persist":1,"tool_pool_refresh":0,"init_message":2,"init_frame_send":1,"engine_pickup":1,"loop_entry":2,"message_prep":1,"model_config_wait":0,"autocompact":1,"request_announcements":2,"query_setup":1,"auto_mode_context_wait":0,"model_gates":1,"tool_schema_build":2,"message_normalization":5,"client_creation":3,"request_build":5},"turn_start_resume_kind":"none","process_turn_index":1,"time_to_request_loop_lag_ms":9,"time_to_request_cpu_ms":61,"time_to_request_major_faults":4,"process_rss_mib_turn_start":241,"process_anon_mib_turn_start":143,"process_rss_mib_result":266,"process_anon_mib_result":167,"process_peak_rss_mib":278,"process_cpu_ms_between_turns":3330,"process_wall_ms_between_turns":379027,"process_cpu_ms_turn":2280,"process_wall_ms_turn":202402,"process_cpu_ms_streaming":927,"process_wall_ms_streaming":52823,"main_stream_count":9,"main_stream_event_count":1122,"main_stream_chunk_count":853,"input_attachments_detail":{"slowest_producer":"changed_files","slowest_producer_ms":16,"cpu_ms":18,"major_faults":3,"changed_files_reread":1,"touch_compare":{"differs":1},"setup_ms":0,"prompt_producers_ms":0,"ambient_start_ms":2,"ambient_wait_ms":16,"render_ms":1,"producers":36,"token_counts":0,"changed_files_read_ms":5,"differs_files":{"size_under_25_kb":1}},"first_content_frame_ms":574,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":1,"process_start_tuning":0}
